# African drumming classes march 2016

An exciting new course starts today, Tuesday March 1st. Nathaniel will begin a whole new rhythm and the course will run for 5 weeks. If you have never tried drumming before and would like to give it a go, now is the time. Families with children aged 8+ are encouraged to come along. You don't need your own drum to sign up, there are a large selection of drums available for hire. Don't forget if you buy a new drum handmade by Nathaniel, you get the 5 week course for FREE. Beginners 5.30pm African dance 6.30pm (only $10 if you are a drumming student) Experienced 7.30pm [Book here](/product/5-drumming-classes-sunshine-coast/) for the next 5 week course starting March 1st.
